        {
          heading: 'Operator, Technical Stack & Open Source Attribution',
          paragraphs: [
            ['AICheck365 is operated and maintained at ', tLink(REPO_URL, REPO_URL, true), ' and reachable at ', tLink('contact@aicheck365.com', MAILTO_MAIN), '.'],
